  "label": "Immigration Fraud Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that immigrants, particularly those from non-Western countries, are prone to committing fraud to gain legal status. This is a common trope used to delegitimize immigrants and to justify their deportation. The meme uses this stereotype to falsely accuse the woman of being an illegal alien.",
